+   * \param num_producers  Must be `< 1 << (32 - kConsumerBits)`.
+   * \param num_consumers  Must be in `[1, 1 << kConsumerBits)`, and the `n` of
+   *                       all callers has to sum to exactly this, otherwise the
+   *                       Event is never reset.
